  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 2907.09 Monitoring Plans. The owner or operator of an affected source shall comply with the requirements of 40 CFR §75.62, except that the monitoring plan shall also include all of the information required by 40 CFR 75, Subpart H.\n\nSource. #7888, eff 5-13-03; ss by #9908, INTERIM, eff 5-13-11, EXPIRES: 11-9-11; ss by #10002, eff 10-1-11 (from Env-A 2910.09); ss by #12995, eff 2-25-20",
